## Commands (high-signal)

Configure: `orcan init` · `orcan sync` · `orcan context wizard` · `orcan context add` · `orcan context show` · `orcan seed --all`

Run: `orcan build` · `orcan build --claude` · `orcan up` · `orcan up --with-docker` · `orcan down` · `orcan doctor` · `orcan update`

Maintainers: `make validate` · `make docs-check` · `make test` · `make release` · `make help`

Claude-only local: `orcan build --claude` → `orcan:<VERSION>-claude`, then `IMAGE_LOCAL=… orcan up`.
Release: `make bump-patch` → commit `VERSION`+`CHANGELOG.md` → `make release` (GitHub Release; no image publish).

## Boundaries

Allowed: edit this repo; CLI/Make/Compose checks; image builds; update docs when the interface changes.

Not allowed: host paths outside the project; modify `.env` unless asked; `docker system prune`; delete `ORCAN_DATA` except via explicit `orcan uninstall --purge-data`; `--privileged`; claim build success without running the build.

## Done checklist

- [ ] `make validate` passes
- [ ] `make test-host` passes
- [ ] `make docs-check` passes when docs/interface changed
- [ ] `./bin/orcan help` works
- [ ] Compose config OK
- [ ] No secrets in image or repo
- [ ] Report: tests ran / skipped / limits

